LG-Fax 1.52 for Windows NT

LG-Fax is a fax software for Windows NT. With LG-Fax you can send
a facsimile from every Windows application via a fax modem connected
to your computer. You can even receive a facsimile with LG-Fax.

LG-Fax has many features:

- Send a facsimile from every Windows application
  (even 16 bit programs of Windows 3.1).
- Receive an incoming facsimile.
- Every outgoing and incoming facsimile is stored automatically
  in an archive. You can view and delete facsimiles form the archive
  with the LG-Fax journal program.
- Address book for sending a facsimile.
- Every outgoing page contains a header line with the name and fax
  number of the sender, the current date and time, the current page
  number and the number of pages.
- Every user can configure his own header line.
- Automatic redialing for facsimiles which can't be transmitted
  (e.g. when the line is busy). You can configure the number of dialing
  trials and the time between two trials.
- You can view, rotate, scale, print and export a facsimile.
- You can save and load fax pages. So you can send documents which contain
  pages form different applications. Example: You write a text with a word
  processor and you want to send this text together with a spreadsheet and
  a chart. So you can use three different programms for creating each page
  and you send the pages as one document.
- You can forward an incoming or outgoing fax to another fax machine.
- You can activate and deactivate the automatic reception of a fax.
- You can start and stop the LG-Fax communication service with icons.
  So you can share the fax modem with other applications.
- LG-Fax is a true 32 bit application with high performance.
- LG-Fax is very easy to use: You can send a facsimile from an application
  with only three steps (print a document to the LG-Fax printer, enter the
  fax number, press "Send" button).
- LG-Fax contains an interface to the e-mail application NT-Mail. So you can
  send a facsimile from UNIX via LG-Fax.
  (You need NT-Mail version 2.11)

Versions of LG-Fax:

LG-Fax is available in two versions and in two languages:

- LG-Fax Workstation: Stand-alone solution of LG-Fax.
- LG-Fax Client/Server: Client/Server solution of LG-Fax.
  LG-Fax Client contains the user interface and LG-Fax Server is
  responsible for the transmission of outgoing facsimiles and the
  receiption of incoming facsimiles.
- LG-Fax Workstation and LG-Fax Client/Server are available in
  German and English.
- LG-Fax Client for Windows for Workgroups 3.1/3.11 and Windows 95
  is available.
- LG-Fax Workstation and LG-Fax Client/Server is also available for
  the Alpha processor.
- LG-Fax Auto Print: Add-on for LG-Fax Workstation/Server. Prints
  every incoming and/or outgoing facsimile to a configured printer.

System requirements:
 
- Computer with Windows NT Workstation or Windows NT Server, Version 3.5
  or higher.
- Fax modem with the Class 2 or Class 2.0 Standard.

