Date: Fri, 19 Jan 1996 16:37:52 +0000
From: Ken Wilson <wilson@angri.sca.dec.com>
Subject: Re: Logon Problem - cannot load profile

Naresh,

Usernames are only for user naming, not security.  For each username
and groupname is a security identifier (SID).  When you created the
"new" account with the same username a new SID was assigned.  You
will need to set ownership of the files and directories the user had to
the new username (i.e. SID).

-Ken

